WEBVTT

01:46.270 --> 01:48.500
Hey, do you have a minute?

01:49.000 --> 01:51.000
Oh, sure.

01:56.110 --> 01:57.770
Popular Actress Brutally Murdered!
Death Threats Come True!!

01:59.380 --> 02:00.970
Sayako Karasuma
Also Murdered

02:01.220 --> 02:04.480
I see, so it was Sayo.

02:07.520 --> 02:10.320
I remember when she was little.

02:11.060 --> 02:14.690
She stopped by the day before the murder.

02:15.630 --> 02:20.360
Even if I'd seen her, I don't know if there's
anything I could have done.

02:20.740 --> 02:23.570
But perhaps I could have said something.

02:24.770 --> 02:29.180
You can't change someone else's destiny.

02:30.710 --> 02:33.480
Did Saya convert to a different faith?

02:33.980 --> 02:37.850
I believe so, not long after she
left the Children's Center.

02:37.850 --> 02:39.750
The White Bell Society?!

02:39.950 --> 02:41.490
Yeah...

02:41.490 --> 02:43.120
You mean...

02:46.090 --> 02:49.160
Go! Don't lose to a girl!

02:49.160 --> 02:51.190
You can do it, Kiriko!

02:55.900 --> 02:58.400
Maybe you'll have a chance
ten years from now!

02:58.710 --> 03:00.980
Darn it! One more try!

03:00.980 --> 03:03.380
Fine! I'll cream you again!

03:03.380 --> 03:07.540
Dumb girl. When's she going to grow up?

03:08.380 --> 03:10.920
The children are crazy about her!

03:10.920 --> 03:14.860
Well, she's really just a kid herself.

03:15.520 --> 03:16.990
Go! Go!

03:16.990 --> 03:18.960
Speaking of which, where's the young lady?

03:18.960 --> 03:19.960
What?

03:19.960 --> 03:22.260
You know, Maya Kuroshio?

03:22.260 --> 03:27.860
Oh, well, I can't just take advantage
of her kindness endlessly.

03:28.240 --> 03:29.860
Ah, right.

03:34.010 --> 03:35.010
What is it?

03:35.010 --> 03:39.910
I came to ask you a favor,
but it's hard to ask now.

03:40.220 --> 03:41.840
Oh?

03:42.020 --> 03:45.110
Hey, will you jump rope with us now?

03:45.320 --> 03:48.320
No way! We're having a pog match next!

03:48.320 --> 03:49.620
No fair!

03:49.620 --> 03:51.990
Come now, no fighting!

03:52.930 --> 03:57.430
If you don't play fair,
the Phantom Monorail will come get you!

03:57.430 --> 03:59.300
Huh? Phantom Monorail?

03:59.630 --> 04:03.640
Haven't you heard?
It comes late at night, after midnight!

04:03.640 --> 04:06.980
But nobody's allowed out, right?

04:06.980 --> 04:09.340
That's why it's a phantom monorail!

04:09.340 --> 04:11.310
It'll take you straight to Hell!

04:12.680 --> 04:15.350
A phantom monorail, huh?

04:15.350 --> 04:20.310
Fourth Night


04:15.350 --> 04:20.310
The Ghost That
Goes For a Stroll

04:27.360 --> 04:30.770
The time is now midnight.

04:30.770 --> 04:35.070
A permit is required to remain outdoors.

04:35.070 --> 04:39.670
Persons without a permit are advised
to return home immediately.

06:05.530 --> 06:07.990
Help!

06:23.440 --> 06:24.410
Midnight
Tragedy

06:24.780 --> 06:25.410
Dark


06:24.780 --> 06:25.410
Dancer


06:24.780 --> 06:25.410
Mysterious Skull

06:25.410 --> 06:26.350
Mysterious Skull
Message?!

06:26.350 --> 06:27.250
Mysterious Skull
Message?!

06:26.350 --> 06:27.250

Ha!

06:27.250 --> 06:27.420
Ha!

06:27.420 --> 06:29.620
They finally noticed?!

06:29.620 --> 06:34.680
The police are looking for connections
to Yui Onizuka's murder, it says.

06:36.490 --> 06:39.160
All right, we'll check the victim's background.

06:39.160 --> 06:40.360
Right!

06:40.360 --> 06:43.560
If it leads back to the White Bell Society...

07:05.090 --> 07:09.060
I found it! I finally found it!

07:09.060 --> 07:10.680
The voice of God!

07:18.400 --> 07:20.030
Excuse me.

07:22.070 --> 07:23.940
It's you.

07:25.610 --> 07:29.810
Did you have a chance to look over
yesterday's documents, Director?

07:29.810 --> 07:31.440
Yes...

07:36.580 --> 07:40.320
Something marvelous is about to happen!

07:44.290 --> 07:47.360
I hope that car gets here soon.

07:47.360 --> 07:51.500
You should really quit imposing
on Father Kanzaki.

07:51.500 --> 07:54.140
I mean, who mooches a car?!

07:54.140 --> 07:56.740
It's not mooching.
I'll pay him back when I'm rich!

07:56.740 --> 07:58.370
Oh, please!

07:58.440 --> 08:01.700
So? Did you get some details on the victim?

08:01.880 --> 08:04.210
Shogo Suzuki, age 35.

08:04.210 --> 08:07.480
He worked at the Otomo Pharmaceutical
Biochem Lab, but...

08:07.480 --> 08:11.250
"You check out the
White Bell Society angle," right?

08:11.250 --> 08:14.880
Bingo! You're starting to sound
like a real assistant!

08:15.260 --> 08:18.420
That's partner, not assistant!

08:18.990 --> 08:20.830
With a face like yours?!

08:20.830 --> 08:22.660
Leave my face out of it!

08:22.660 --> 08:24.770
What about you? Let me guess...

08:24.770 --> 08:29.230
Yep! The inner sanctum!
The Otomo Pharmaceuticals Biochem Lab!

08:31.610 --> 08:33.410
Otomo
Pharmaceuticals
Biochemistry
Lab

08:33.410 --> 08:35.080
Otomo
Pharmaceuticals
Biochemistry
Lab

08:33.410 --> 08:35.080
Shoot...

08:35.080 --> 08:35.740
Otomo
Pharmaceuticals
Biochemistry
Lab

08:37.250 --> 08:40.420
Damn it! Don't give me that
"contact our PR department" crap!

08:40.420 --> 08:43.080
Just who do you think you are?

08:49.060 --> 08:50.680
Lunch hour, huh?

08:52.090 --> 08:54.800
Hey, did you hear about Chief Suzuki?

08:54.800 --> 08:59.560
I sure did. The whole office was whispering
all morning! I couldn't do a lick of work!

08:59.970 --> 09:02.340
Do you think it was you-know-what?

09:02.340 --> 09:04.770
Probably, it must have been!

09:05.410 --> 09:08.140
Hey, what's this "you-know-what," ladies?

09:08.140 --> 09:09.840
Wh-Who're you?!

09:09.840 --> 09:11.640
Oh, me?

09:11.710 --> 09:13.050
Here's my card.

09:13.050 --> 09:15.450
Wow, a Tokyo newspaper!

09:15.450 --> 09:17.080
Impressive!

09:17.750 --> 09:20.250
So, will you tell me what you
were talking about?

09:20.250 --> 09:23.990
I'll make it worth your while, of course!

09:28.200 --> 09:30.160
The Phantom Monorail...

09:30.160 --> 09:31.800
Phantom Monorail?

09:31.800 --> 09:35.870
Haven't you heard?
The one they say runs after midnight!

09:35.870 --> 09:39.770
And anyone who sees it dies a tragic death!

09:39.970 --> 09:45.810
I get it. And you think it's connected
to Chief Suzuki's death, hmm?

09:45.810 --> 09:47.180
That's right.

09:47.180 --> 09:50.550
And some people say the Phantom
is really our director!

09:50.550 --> 09:53.990
Don't say that!
It's so believable it's not funny!

10:01.360 --> 10:03.360
Speak of the Devil!

10:03.360 --> 10:05.200
Hey, who was that?

10:05.200 --> 10:06.870
Director Usami...

10:06.870 --> 10:09.100
Did he know Chief Suzuki?

10:09.100 --> 10:13.610
They're in separate divisions, but I've seen
them yelling at each other several times.

10:13.610 --> 10:15.240
Thank you!

10:17.480 --> 10:19.170
Hey!

10:25.320 --> 10:26.950
'Scuse me!

10:27.660 --> 10:29.820
Could you give me a light?

10:29.820 --> 10:32.760
Sorry, I don't smoke.

10:34.460 --> 10:39.660
I hear you and Mr. Suzuki were
shouting at each other?

10:45.310 --> 10:46.930
Hey, you!

10:55.220 --> 10:56.880
Damn it!

10:56.880 --> 10:59.790
Oops! What a waste!

11:00.090 --> 11:03.060
Hey! Oh, uh, can I...

11:07.230 --> 11:09.960
Littering's a misdemeanor!

11:09.960 --> 11:12.070
Thank you, Sir!

11:12.070 --> 11:13.730
You know who he is?

11:13.730 --> 11:15.770
What, don't you?

11:15.770 --> 11:21.570
It's the White Bell Society volunteer brigade.
They run a city clean-up program!

11:21.710 --> 11:25.410
Course, it's my job to clean up scum like you!

11:25.410 --> 11:26.680
Ow-ow-ow!

11:26.680 --> 11:28.920
Hey, what were you saying to Mr. Usami?

11:28.920 --> 11:30.020
Huh?

11:30.020 --> 11:32.390
I just asked him for a light!

11:32.390 --> 11:33.420
Liar!

11:33.420 --> 11:35.360
Geez, you're a pain!

11:35.360 --> 11:37.460
What's it to you, anyway?

11:37.460 --> 11:40.730
Oh, he's a relevant party, that's all.

11:40.730 --> 11:44.430
'Course, if you ask me, he's the killer.

11:44.430 --> 11:45.430
What?

11:45.430 --> 11:47.100
My cop instincts.

11:47.100 --> 11:49.040
I don't like his face!

12:28.380 --> 12:30.440
Oh, you're back?

12:32.550 --> 12:35.220
Whew, I'm beat.

12:35.220 --> 12:36.880
So? How was it?

12:36.880 --> 12:41.090
Hard to say. No White Bell Society leads,
just some Phantom talk.

12:41.090 --> 12:42.560
What?

12:42.560 --> 12:43.860
How 'bout you?

12:43.860 --> 12:46.050
Oh, me?

12:46.560 --> 12:49.550
Ta-daa! The White Bell Society report!

12:49.630 --> 12:52.430
Hey, well done, Miss Assistant!

12:52.430 --> 12:54.160
Partner, you mean!

12:54.670 --> 12:56.500
Mayor Kusaka?

12:56.670 --> 13:02.080
Well, it is the biggest religious group
in the city, lots of voters.

13:02.680 --> 13:04.710
And who's this?

13:04.710 --> 13:07.840
Still working on it, a mystery lady.

13:08.080 --> 13:11.620
But she's definitely one of
the group's leaders.

13:11.620 --> 13:13.250
Hmm...

13:19.260 --> 13:23.320
Right, I'll leave the client list issue to you.

13:25.730 --> 13:27.900
Would you like a beer, darling?

13:27.900 --> 13:31.340
Thanks, I was just in the mood for one.

13:34.440 --> 13:40.050
Our client list may have been leaked.
I'm having Masaki look into it.

13:40.050 --> 13:41.780
Masaki?

13:41.780 --> 13:46.550
Don't worry, it won't influence your affairs.

13:47.460 --> 13:49.950
More importantly, how's Maya?

13:53.590 --> 13:55.320
Where do you think you're going?

13:55.600 --> 13:57.630
Mother, I...

13:57.630 --> 14:00.600
Why do you go to that heretic's church?

14:02.840 --> 14:04.740
To see that man?

14:04.740 --> 14:06.400
Mother!

14:37.510 --> 14:40.100
Make it quick and to the point.

14:44.850 --> 14:47.580
What is it? I'm busy.

14:47.820 --> 14:50.950
The press is asking questions about Suzuki.

14:50.950 --> 14:53.390
I've appointed a task group in PR.

14:53.790 --> 14:57.560
More importantly, how's the research coming?

14:57.560 --> 15:02.690
We've progressed from a camel to a lion,
and we're proceeding to the next phase.

15:05.900 --> 15:08.700
The Thus
Will Spoke
to Zarathustra
Power

15:19.210 --> 15:21.480
