Spoke
Zarathustra

15:26.720 --> 15:29.750
"Thus Spoke Zara..." whosit?

15:39.830 --> 15:41.530
Hey, you!

15:41.970 --> 15:45.070
You really pulled a fast one yesterday!

15:45.070 --> 15:48.410
Oh, uh, I was in a hurry, see.

15:48.410 --> 15:51.900
Where's the money you owe us?

15:52.280 --> 15:54.580
I'm afraid I don't have it on me.

15:54.580 --> 15:56.210
Say what?!

15:58.120 --> 16:02.350
Would this do the job, ladies?

16:05.930 --> 16:09.190
Man, you really saved me.

16:10.060 --> 16:14.870
An Ally of Justice always knows
when he's needed!

16:14.870 --> 16:18.030
Thank you, I'll make it up to you.

16:18.770 --> 16:20.870
Don't worry, any time.

16:24.450 --> 16:27.610
Are you familiar with the
concept of "resentment"?

16:27.980 --> 16:29.550
What's that?

16:29.550 --> 16:36.020
A psychological state in which
society's weak despise the strong.

16:36.020 --> 16:37.650
Oh...

16:39.560 --> 16:41.900
Right now, your "Skull Man" monster's
the talk of the town.

