19:05.840 --> 19:07.470
Watch out!

19:08.780 --> 19:10.440
You!

19:10.440 --> 19:14.680
An Ally of Justice always knows
when he's needed!

19:18.990 --> 19:23.250
A Mauser? Reminds me of the Continent!

19:23.490 --> 19:25.960
How come you have a gun?!

19:25.960 --> 19:29.660
