20:38.000 --> 20:43.040
I'm not going anywhere with this wound.
I can handle the cops.

20:43.040 --> 20:44.970
Yeah, but you...

20:44.970 --> 20:49.100
Don't worry, detectives are all-mighty!

20:49.840 --> 20:52.210
Crazy old maniac!

20:53.080 --> 20:56.680
Now the Skull Man will be targeting you!

20:58.050 --> 21:00.280
I'm honored.

